OL,3,AMilitary base asylum centre near
OL,4,APiddington granted planning approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Home Office spokesperson said the
OL,7,Fplanning permission "allows us to
OL,8,Fcontinue to progress the use of MoD
OL,9,FBicester" but no final decision on the
OL,10,Fproposal had been taken.
